            "review_title": "Review at BBQ Plan-K",
            "review_text": "Colin L\nSingapore, Singapore1004 contributions\n0\nWagyu, Korean BBQ style\nApr 2024 • Friends\nServing only Pork and Beef Korean BBQ style dishes, this restaurant provides excellent service and great food.\n\nThe meat is perfectly grilled at your table by one of their service associates. Unlike some Korean BBQ outlets where you leave smelling of BBQ, this out has a long exhaust pipe which is placed inches above the grill. That way, all the BBQ smoke is drawn away from the people around the grill.\n\nThe beef that we had was all Wagyu grade. Lightly seasoned and grilled to perfection, it just melts in your mouth.\n\nTypical of Korean restaurants, the assortment of side was also varied. \n\nI tried something I never had before. This was BBQ Pork Cheeks. This was yummy.\n\nOverall a breat restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten April 6, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
