            "review_text": "Rolf C\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nPlank K a famous restaurant to be on the downgrade\nMay 2023 • Couples\nwe've been going to Plan K for many years. In the past few weeks, you could see that the prices have been raised significantly. Unfortunately, the portions have also gotten smaller and the legendary side dishes have been replaced with cheaper ingredients. There used to be long queues to get a table, but that is no longer the case. maybe the management will recognize in time that the restaurant has lost a lot of its good reputation.\nRead more\nWritten May 20, 2023",
