            "review_text": "lionelnguyensg\n20 contributions\n0\nHidden gem\nJun 2020 • Family\nThis restaurant gave me a family feeling that was quite similar to Japanese traditional style. Indeed. It is a Korean BBQ style. The staff was friendly and the price was reasonable (a hidden gem in the chaotic BBQ chain in Vietnam). Also, as an experienced person in hospitality, the coziness is all for a Asian style family.\nI will come back and recommend more.\nRead more\nWritten June 15, 2020",
